# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# MULTI-AI D&D ENGINE - Environment Variables
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your API keys.
# You only need keys for the providers you want to use!
#
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Anthropic (Claude) - https://console.anthropic.com/
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-xxxxx

# OpenAI (GPT-4, GPT-4o) - https://platform.openai.com/
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-xxxxx

# Google (Gemini) - https://makersuite.google.com/app/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=xxxxx

# xAI (Grok) - https://console.x.ai/
XAI_API_KEY=xai-xxxxx

# OpenRouter (access many models with one key!) - https://openrouter.ai/
# This is great if you want to use GPT + Gemini without separate keys
OPENROUTER_KEY=sk-or-xxxxx

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# MINIMUM SETUP:
# You need at least ONE key to run. Recommended setups:
#
# Budget-friendly:
#   - Just ANTHROPIC_API_KEY (Claude plays all roles)
#
# Two-AI party:
#   - ANTHROPIC_API_KEY + OPENAI_API_KEY
#
# Full multi-AI party:
#   - ANTHROPIC_API_KEY + OPENROUTER_KEY (or individual keys for each)
#
# Maximum chaos:
#   - All of them. Let the AIs PLAY.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
